        <mxCell id="collab55" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="5.0 Record Ingestion (Student Onboarding)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="34" width="380" x="440" y="1274" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="collab56" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" value="6.0 Fines and Notifications (student view)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="34" width="380" x="840" y="1274" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="collab57" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;Notation.&lt;/b&gt; Objects are underlined (instance:Class). Message numbers continue the numbering of the UML Sequence Diagram (1.x search, 2.x issue, 3.x monitoring and fines, 4.x return) and extend it with 5.x ingestion and 6.x fines. Arrows show message direction along each link (→ ← ↑ ↓); &lt;i&gt;italic&lt;/i&gt; text is a return. Flow 3 starts either from the scheduler (3) or manually from the librarian (3a, whose request then runs 3.1 to 3.8)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="78" width="1190" x="1250" y="1230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
